# A module that reaches a socket only through an aliased helper import is
# missing from node-synthetic.
expect exit 1
expect FAIL [profile.ci] node::tests::via_helper::reaches_a_socket_through_an_aliased_import runs in no group, needs node-synthetic: module via_helper is flagged (via_helper::reaches_a_socket_through_an_aliased_import calls helpers::bound_transport)
